# ==============================================================================
# Progressive Credential Loading (PCL) Configuration
# Repository: text-to-sql-guardrails
# ==============================================================================
#
# TIER 1: ZERO-SETUP / LOCAL DEV / CI (Default)
# - No OpenAI API key required.
# - System runs in Mock Mode using deterministic, schema-validated SQL queries.
# - Database operates with embedded in-memory SQLite (sql.js).
#
# TIER 2: LOCAL DEV WITH LIVE AI
# - Supply an OpenAI API key (sk-...) to activate live GPT-4o-mini SQL generation
#   and real-time LLM-as-judge hallucination back-translation.
#
# TIER 3: PRODUCTION KUBERNETES DEPLOYMENT
# - Inject credentials via Kubernetes Secrets or Helm values.
#
# ── AI Provider ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UNSET or sk-dummy (default): Deterministic mock SQL generation & validation
# SET to real sk-... key: Live GPT-4o-mini generation and hallucination check
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ── Port ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=4001
